    "type": "question",
    "label": "7",
    "prompt": "A school has 2137 students. The number of boys at the school is 1586. How many girls are there at the school?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "551 girls.",
      "worked": "Subtract the number of boys from the total number of students.\n\n$$\\begin{array}{rrrrr}&2&1&3&7\\\\-&1&5&8&6\\\\\\hline&&5&5&1\\\\\\hline\\end{array}$$\n\nThere are 551 girls.\n\nCheck: $1586+551=2137$.",
